<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's Guinness 3-month profits climb.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's Guinness 3-month profits climb.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months result for Guinness Nigeria Plc to end-September 1996. (In million naira).</p>
<p>				     1996	  1995</p>
<p>     Turnover		    2,000	 1,900</p>
<p>     Profit before taxation  195.3	 175.4</p>
<p>     Turnover		     62.5	  64.9</p>
<p>     Profit after taxation   132.8	 110.5</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
